			<div class="content" id="post-content-1675102">
									

<p>I think it should talk about the time travel aspects before the addenda is what I mainly meant. It obviously has some non-hearsay time travel elements, considering it would need to travel many hundreds of light years in 5 years, not accounting for the facts that it apparently changed the course of their civilization. The fact that it's not mentioned at all in the main text is confusing to me, and is actually the main element of its anomalous nature. A DVD from the future isn't anomalous for the message it carries, but the fact that it went back in time.</p>

